# Docker build context trim — adapters/terminal-bench/Dockerfile builds FROM the repo root
# (COPY package.json/bun.lock/bunfig.toml, tsconfig*.json, src/, adapters/terminal-bench/*).
# Everything the image does NOT need is excluded so the context isn't the multi-GB monorepo.
# node_modules is REBUILT inside the image via `bun install --frozen-lockfile` — never ship the
# host copy (platform-specific binaries + ~277 MB).
node_modules
**/node_modules

# VCS + CI
.git
.github

# Native / rust build artifacts (GBs: crates/native/target per the monorepo layout)
target
**/target
*.app
*.dylib
*.node

# Other surfaces the terminal-bench image does not build (only src/ + the adapter are copied)
apps
crates
native
src-tauri

# Bench trajectories, cassettes, datasets, extracted corpora (never needed at image-build)
**/*.jsonl
.extracted_source
docs/analysis
tools/leaderboard-dashboard/rawdata

# Python / pytest caches inside the adapter (rebuilt; not shippable)
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.benchmarks
**/*.pyc

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
